{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bb73d1bc7ae0aabd6cb58fa3d69553a4bd78f463deba8b4c9c3eb86874ed4237", "ja": "新曲を歌うのは誰か？　思案中のプロデュー\nサーの元へ集まってくる面々。仲間でも譲れ\nないと正々堂々競い合う姿を見て、プロデュ\nーサーが辿り着いた答えは……みんなで歌う\nこと。公演の日、劇場は大歓声に包まれた。", "zh": "新歌究竟要给谁唱？众偶像们聚集到\n正在苦思此事的制作人身旁。看到她们\n面对伙伴也毫不退缩、公平竞争的样子，\n制作人最后得出的答案是……大家一起唱。\n公演当天，剧场响起了盛大的欢呼声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1513c53eed4125613ae45e1acfe7c207c1c8f163d884e6df1f8eb4b171392eb", "ja": "（今日の公演は、大歓声に包まれて終わった。\nこのステージで初披露となった『Welcome！！』）", "zh": "（『Welcome!!』这首歌首次登台亮相，\n而今天的公演也在观众如雷贯耳的欢呼声中落幕。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f945c99962f2e0fa2ba58eb77adab7eeb03e7917de235492d480c5955255c95a", "ja": "（それを歌ったのは……）", "zh": "（而演唱这首歌的人是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "2f5b17442372fb43de8330adca1894b118e5a72b5576cbd0a671b17e31b4dee9", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん！\n見ててくれましたかっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！\n你刚刚有看吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "deff533b2a0d5e12a0abd392e18d92a85bebfcc71213818c4fece73a877778a1", "ja": "私、とっても楽しかったです♪\nやっぱりライブは楽しいな～♪　矢吹可奈～♪", "zh": "我真的好开心喔♪\n办演唱会就是好玩呢～♪矢吹可奈～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "527c2f5407dd2914bf39fd80bbb5e63171f0c24f7ab08a62ee9e5a922dc791a2", "ja": "……{$P$}さんは、甘いです。\nひとりを選べないからって、みんなで歌うなんて……。", "zh": "……{$P$}先生真随便。\n居然因为选不出来，就让所有人一起唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1005_p", "source_sha256": "df0abfceac272cb87232caddd146b3198abc746141ef4f223541e37a041cf3b3", "ja": "いや、別にひとりに選べなかったから\nみんなで歌うことにしたわけじゃないぞ。", "zh": "不，我并不是因为选不出来，\n才决定让所有人一起唱的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b456b359df44ab67a8e35eeb66fca312baeb190d997eaeb65ffaa6da57d5824e", "ja": "この曲は、ここにいるメンバーや他のメンバー、\n劇場の全員で歌うのが1番いいと判断したんだ。", "zh": "我是确实经过考量，认为这首歌给大家，\n给整个剧场的伙伴一起唱才是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "f67b026f0112c94ea22aad9078bc79740cc5e2aa3e44302fb640fafe1f025c37", "ja": "にゃはは、カリカリしないのっ。\nそれより今日のステージ、志保はどうだった？", "zh": "呀哈哈，不要生气啦。\n话说今天的表演，志保觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "e18c2dbd328048f8a69fad6db9f975430b0dcb10d1d2431276dbfc904b09deee", "ja": "どうって……。\nまあ、悪くはなかったですけど。", "zh": "觉得怎么样……\n我是觉得还不错啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "aaf307bf5aef7f4247837b9ee5c719e4feef10de329989944c3f28e651f8020e", "ja": "でしょ～～～？　だったらホラ、笑顔笑顔♪", "zh": "是吧～～～？既然这样，那就笑一个笑一个♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "bb116c0786991f5b1a7760a70b6d0b7c0fa507624afd4ec37ca6d634badef02f", "ja": "そんな難しい顔してたら、せっかくの\n楽しかったライブが台なしになっちゃうっしょ？", "zh": "你这样愁眉苦脸，不就糟蹋了\n大家开开心心的演唱会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "97f113064faed2bad34b46f0e38054b9727ffd1fb554c3230125ca6a62cf78b6", "ja": "はぁ……わかりました。\nまあ、公演としては成功だったと思いますし。", "zh": "唉……我知道了。\n我自己也觉得这是一场成功的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "610ae344b0b70204f8782185394cf981b402daf04829b970557fb77a59f2378f", "ja": "でも、可奈。勝負はお預けになったけど、\n私は負けるつもりはないから。……みんなにも。", "zh": "不过可奈，这次虽然没有分出高下，\n但我不会输给你……也不会输给其他人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "0d24f9a722cc8cfdf3c4b5a63887b254487459a9253412fed00e6a5c9d2e6443", "ja": "うん♪", "zh": "嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "74cca9d3aa60f43231fa483b6f51877f1cbd93d0c7a68e89a03031f48df8fec4", "ja": "もちろん、私もやでー！\n次こそ志保を負かしたるからな！", "zh": "别忘了还有我嘿～！\n我下次一定要赢过志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "84e26a17090e56031960bada25bbf43d2f2f1d98ea458b05287aa84b40149b66", "ja": "そうですか。\n楽しみにしていますね。", "zh": "这样啊。\n我很期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5c576f4bd912fcfee5337c60818cea536e02de10b4944be5519d35b467f23ad8", "ja": "杏奈、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "杏奈，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "abd44cbbba322d92102ab01ab758d28642887d5cb77e0ccc488668a39d9a5fdb", "ja": "{$P$}、さん……。杏奈……\n歌ってる時ね……不思議な感じが、した……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……杏奈……\n在唱歌的时候……有不可思议的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "30fde45ed531f85ff9fb978d13973ee1897b86ac2a4878facf00732ecc060f05", "ja": "新しい歌がね……喜んでる、気がして……。", "zh": "杏奈觉得……这首新歌，好像很高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "eeaae5f064bcab48a6d1060d12977fdef91bc75cdb437076869a8cb9b7b992ef", "ja": "ずっと……キラキラ、してて……\n杏奈……すごく……楽しかった……です♪", "zh": "一直……闪闪发光的……\n杏奈……非常地……享受……唱这首歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1021_p", "source_sha256": "8e8c5563841e3349d9f12827080d23855b2bb54f6f7ed4df73ad2fcfa6a4056f", "ja": "歌が喜んでる……か。\n確かに不思議だけど……。", "zh": "歌曲觉得高兴……这样啊。\n说来确实是很不可思议，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1f3db4b801f9e3e9b00c7bd8e5435e6095882b3d0c964458e0aa024a1bd2bb07", "ja": "もしかしたら、杏奈やみんなの気持ちが、\n歌にも伝わったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "说不定是杏奈和大家的心情，\n也传达给了歌曲本身呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "89f34baaeafa9c1d75824f63e0c3d2961c05d14c0953113400d5c3fd10875bde", "ja": "うん……♪", "zh": "嗯……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "0e1ef627067ec8c22d65128ab2a23574a7235f8bc7037657f17ec5ed0bc0ce0a", "ja": "わかるわ～！　私らに歌われるんを、\n曲が待っててくれた感じやったな♪", "zh": "我懂～！感觉就好像这首歌\n一直在等我们来唱它呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "0ed4f8dfef5cc4e0cf90edb1739e187ebc5f2be02f6ab4c378ba278826ef6f22", "ja": "そういうのは、よくわかりませんけど……\n人によって、色々な魅力が出せる曲だとは思いました。", "zh": "我不是很明白那种感觉……但我觉得，\n这是一首可以让不同的人唱出不同魅力的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "632a2a65a8d4bfc562f520069f06d8ca633e18f53650bd097885e53ebfbb02ec", "ja": "つまりー、たこ焼きみたいな曲ってこと？", "zh": "也就是说，这首歌就像章鱼烧一样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "521fc5d6d349db6c3a2df87cb8922104c98d88ce5cf7e02e7b498ca99290a628", "ja": "え……。\n一応聞いとくけど、なんでたこ焼きなん？", "zh": "咦……\n我问一下，为什么是章鱼烧啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "fa4f01694f9608131559fb8e66898b2955b96e62eb064c4ab48dae57a781721c", "ja": "え？　だってたこ焼きって、色んなもの入れるじゃん？", "zh": "咦？章鱼烧不是会放很多种料进去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "ae051aff4c411605efe203ccc961ff11ae5d6eaf5c4daf766027bbbddbfa90cb", "ja": "タコ入ってるのもチョコ入ってるのも、\nソーセージ入ってるのも全部おいしいし！", "zh": "不管是放章鱼、巧克力，\n还是放香肠的都很好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "7b82974fc578c5955f56b5d97080806fe5f8a2751a62b5d8fbe5e2f30d255432", "ja": "いや、家で作る時はそうやけどな？", "zh": "呃，在家自己做的话是这样没错啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "b3893baabb3809d9e73b5bd656b2e47f26709ee742db2e5a361eb72bbc675b57", "ja": "あ、あのっ！\n私達ってたこ焼きだったんですか！？", "zh": "那、那个！\n我们其实是章鱼烧吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "e3d497d22b3d3d63cdf4b122237b2be33b389736c1ffbafbc25f25eb4f4f6121", "ja": "たこ焼き……食べたい、かも……。\n杏奈……お腹……空いてきた……。", "zh": "章鱼烧……有点想吃……\n杏奈……肚子……饿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "89ccc70edb4ab7d7f87cd1379f4163370c902b01ff4fb7b5507491c5301be7bc", "ja": "あ、ほな今から食べに行こか！\n駅前に、メッチャおすすめの店があんねん♪", "zh": "啊，那我们现在就去吃吧！\n车站前有一家超棒的店喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "af647885dc9767c21060fa11103624dc6533fb15c1976bc0d269125d47c5d4fd", "ja": "ホントですか！？\n行きたい行きた～い♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n我想去我想去～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1035_024ann", "source_sha256": "d5d53a3d5547d7291c60af12ec3606180508035211cafe84c10193e77ceb4b55", "ja": "行く……。", "zh": "走吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "da26aa9d41ae152bcb94cdc375fb632e9fd13e9d5660dc9a38350e595e48beb1", "ja": "よっしゃ！　たこ焼きパーティー決定や～！", "zh": "好啊！来开章鱼烧派对啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "535d53c32c54db9dc92b226666135ee0091580ac23d87e7c477494fddff4ae84", "ja": "たこ焼き……お土産、買って帰れますね。", "zh": "章鱼烧……可以带回去给家人吃呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1038_p", "source_sha256": "79eff23bc05f8bce43eabf1b2fe579c2440aaeaa35645aab7451984d9bcc37be", "ja": "（本気で競い合っていても、みんな仲がいい。今回は、\nその仲の良さにプロデュースのアイディアをもらった）", "zh": "（即便彼此认真较劲，大家的感情还是很好。\n这次，就是这样的友谊给了我培育的灵感。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_016_1039_p", "source_sha256": "246bd6596e91829e4b7fe17551a42384e41b300ddadabb02c1b3fb4f988ab4db", "ja": "（俺がみんなを導いてるようで、実はみんなに\n導かれてる……そんな事もあるのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（看似我在引导大家，实则相反……\n说不定真是这样子呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
